e winner will be randomly determined.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n&nbsp;\n\n<ul>\n<\/ul>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q129","QuestionID":"QID180","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Recall that: You need to select a pair of numbers that sums up to 100.\u00a0 You have 2 minutes to cor...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">comp_selected_chose_tournament<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 1 <\/span>","LeftOperand":"comp_selected_chose_tournament","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"1","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_5yUcDA5EfVrFIVg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID181","SecondaryAttribute":"You have completed all\u00a0${e:\/\/Field\/n_totalparts} parts and all\u00a0${e:\/\/Field\/n_totalrounds} rounds..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"You have completed all&nbsp;${e:\/\/Field\/n_totalparts} parts and all&nbsp;${e:\/\/Field\/n_totalrounds} rounds in this study.&nbsp;<br><br>All that remains are 4 pages of the final questionnaire. Your answers to this questionnaire will not influence your payment in any way.\n<br><br>Please provide all answers truthfully and carefully.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q130","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"You have completed all\u00a0${e:\/\/Field\/n_totalparts} parts and all\u00a0${e:\/\/Field\/n_totalrounds} rounds...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID181","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n    try {\n        var comp = parseInt(\"${e:\/\/Field\/comp_position}\", 10);\n        var risk = parseInt(\"${e:\/\/Field\/risk_position}\", 10);\n        var gen  = parseInt(\"${e:\/\/Field\/generosity_position}\", 10);\n\n        \/\/ Create array indexed by position\n        var orderArr = [];\n        orderArr[comp] = \"C\";\n        orderArr[risk] = \"R\";\n        orderArr[gen]  = \"G\";\n\n        \/\/ Build string like \"CGR\", \"RCG\", etc.\n        var order_code = orderArr[1] + orderArr[2] + orderArr[3];\n\n        Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"order_code\", order_code);\n\n        console.log(\"order_code =\", order_code);\n\n    } catch (e) {\n        console.error(\"order_code error:\", e);\n    }\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_5yUcDA5EfVrFIVg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID185","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions for Part ${e:\/\/Field\/current_part}, Round 2 of 2 rounds In this round, you earn a fi...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<strong>Instructions for Part ${e:\/\/Field\/current_part}, Round 2 of 2 rounds<\/strong><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span>In this round, you earn a fixed payment of $1.50 for answering 12 questions.<\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nThese questions will ask you to compare your choices between lottery payment and fixed payment to those of other participants who went through the same study and are <strong>equally likely to be men or women.<\/strong>\n<ul>\n\t<li><span>Recall, in Round 1, y<\/span><span>ou <strong>selected the lottery<\/strong> when the fixed payment was <strong>$${e:\/\/Field\/xrisk_xl} or less<\/strong> and the <strong>fixed payment<\/strong> when it was <strong>$${e:\/\/Field\/xrisk_xr} or more<\/strong>.&nbsp;<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions for Part ${e:\/\/Field\/current_part}, Round 2 of 2 rounds In this round, you earn a fi...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<strong>Instructions for Round 4 of Part ${e:\/\/Field\/current_part}<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nIf this round is selected as the round-that-counts, you earn a fixed payment of $1.50 for answering three questions.<br><br>For the Round 5 math task, you chose between a tournament payment where, if you win, you receive $2 per correct problem and a fixed payment varying from $0.05 to $0.80 per correct problem. \n\nYou selected the tournament payment when the fixed payment was {y} or less and the fixed payment when it was {y+1} or more. <br><br>[Depending on their choices, might instead be: \u201cYou never selected the tournament payment\u201d or \u201cYou always selected the tournament payment.\u201d]\n<br><br>That is, you chose the tournament payment in Rows 1 through [X] and the fixed payment in Rows [X+1] through 16. <br><br>[Depending on their choices, might instead be: \u201cYou [T4: You chose the tournament payment in all 16 Rows\u201d or \u201cYou chose the fixed payment in all 16 Rows\u201d]<br>","DataExportTag":"Q185","QuestionID":"QID185","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">xrisk_interior<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 1 <\/span>","LeftOperand":"xrisk_interior","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"1","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function () {\n    var qthis = this;\n    var controller = this.getQuestionContainer();\n\n    \/\/ =========================\n    \/\/ SET THESE QIDs\n    \/\/ =========================\n    var qidQ2Interior = \"QID186\";  \/\/ question 2 if xrisk_interior == 1\n    var qidQ2Bottom = \"QID227\";    \/\/ question 2 if xrisk_bottomcorner == 1\n    var qidQ2Top = \"QID226\";       \/\/ question 2 if xrisk_topcorner == 1\n\n    \/\/ Read embedded variables\n    var isInterior = \"${e:\/\/Field\/xrisk_interior}\" === \"1\";\n    var isBottom   = \"${e:\/\/Field\/xrisk_bottomcorner}\" === \"1\";\n    var isTop      = \"${e:\/\/Field\/xrisk_topcorner}\" === \"1\";\n\n    \/\/ Determine which version of question 2 to use\n    var qidQuestion2 = null;\n    if (isInterior) {\n        qidQuestion2 = qidQ2Interior;\n    } else if (isBottom) {\n        qidQuestion2 = qidQ2Bottom;\n    } else if (isTop) {\n        qidQuestion2 = qidQ2Top;\n    }\n\n    \/\/ Questions to hide\/reveal\n    var questionIDs = [qidQuestion2].filter(Boolean);\n\n    \/\/ Unique key for this page\n    var revealKey = \"revealed_\" + this.questionId;\n\n    function getNextButton() {\n        return document.getElementById(\"NextButton\");\n    }\n\n    function forceHideNextButton() {\n        qthis.hideNextButton();\n        var nextButton = getNextButton();\n        if (nextButton) {\n            nextButton.style.display = \"none\";\n            nextButton.style.visibility = \"hidden\";\n        }\n    }\n\n    function forceShowNextButton() {\n        qthis.showNextButton();\n        var nextButton = getNextButton();\n        if (nextButton) {\n            nextButton.style.display = \"\";\n            nextButton.style.visibility = \"\";\n        }\n    }\n\n    function hideQuestions() {\n        questionIDs.forEach(function (qid) {\n            var q = document.getElementById(qid);\n            if (q) {\n                q.style.visibility = \"hidden\";\n                q.style.height = \"0px\";\n                q.style.overflow = \"hidden\";\n                q.style.margin = \"0\";\n                q.style.padding = \"0\";\n            }\n        });\n    }\n\n    function showQuestions() {\n        questionIDs.forEach(function (qid) {\n            var q = document.getElementById(qid);\n            if (q) {\n                q.style.visibility = \"visible\";\n                q.style.height = \"auto\";\n                q.style.overflow = \"visible\";\n                q.style.margin = \"\";\n                q.style.padding = \"\";\n            }\n        });\n\n        setTimeout(function () {\n            window.dispatchEvent(new Event(\"resize\"));\n        }, 50);\n    }\n\n    var alreadyRevealed = sessionStorage.getItem(revealKey) === \"true\";\n\n    if (alreadyRevealed) {\n        showQuestions();\n        forceShowNextButton();\n        return;\n    }\n\n    \/\/ Hide immediately\n    forceHideNextButton();\n    hideQuestions();\n\n   \n\n    \/\/ Create centered button\n    var wrapper = document.createElement(\"div\");\n    wrapper.style.textAlign = \"center\";\n    wrapper.style.margin = \"30px 0\";\n\n\t\n\t\t\/\/ Styling\n\/\/ Styling\n\/\/ Read embedded color variables\nvar bgColor = \"${e:\/\/Field\/understanding_button_backgroundColor}\";\nvar borderColor = \"${e:\/\/Field\/understanding_button_border}\";\nvar textColor = \"${e:\/\/Field\/understanding_button_color}\";\n\n\/\/ Fallbacks (in case something is missing)\nbgColor = bgColor || \"#FFA500\";\nborderColor = borderColor || \"#cc8400\";\ntextColor = textColor || \"#2b1a00\";\n\nvar button = document.createElement(\"button\");\nbutton.type = \"button\";\nbutton.innerHTML = \"Click to answer an understanding question\";\n\n\/\/ Styling\nbutton.style.padding = \"12px 24px\";\nbutton.style.cursor = \"pointer\";\nbutton.style.backgroundColor = bgColor;\nbutton.style.border = \"1px solid \" + borderColor;\nbutton.style.borderRadius = \"6px\";\nbutton.style.fontSize = \"16px\";\nbutton.style.fontWeight = \"600\";\nbutton.style.color = textColor;\n\t\n\t\n \n\n    wrapper.appendChild(button);\n    controller.appendChild(wrapper);\n\n    button.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n        sessionStorage.setItem(revealKey, \"true\");\n\n        showQuestions();\n        forceShowNextButton();\n\n        wrapper.remove();\n    });\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_5yUcDA5EfVrFIVg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID186","SecondaryAttribute":"Understanding Question: In Round 1, which of the following is correct?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<strong>Understanding Question:<\/strong> In Round 1, which of the following is correct?","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Understanding Question: In Round 1, which of the following is correct?","Choices":{"2":{"Display":"I never selected the lottery."},"3":{"Display":"I always selected the lottery."},"4":{"Display":"I selected the lottery when the fixed payment was $${e:\/\/Field\/risk_self_comp_check_y} or less and the fixed payment when it was $${e:\/\/Field\/risk_self_comp_check_yplus1} or more."}},"ChoiceOrder":["4","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"CustomValidation","CustomValidation":{"Logic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID186\/SelectableChoice\/4","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Understanding Question: In Round 1, which of the following is correct?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">I selected the lottery when the fixed payment was $${e:\/\/Field\/risk_self_comp_check_y} or less and the fixed payment when it was $${e:\/\/Field\/risk_self_comp_check_yplus1} or more.<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID186\/SelectableChoice\/4","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID186","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID186","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression"},"Message":{"description":"Error Text","libraryID":"UR_cZPMLrEO6JJ