}},{"SurveyID":"SV_5yUcDA5EfVrFIVg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID227","SecondaryAttribute":"Understanding Question: In Round 1, which of the following is correct?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<strong>Understanding Question: <\/strong>In Round 1, which of the following is correct?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q175","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Understanding Question: In Round 1, which of the following is correct?","Choices":{"2":{"Display":"I never selected the lottery."},"3":{"Display":"I always selected the lottery."},"4":{"Display":"I selected the lottery when the fixed payment was $${e:\/\/Field\/risk_self_comp_check_y} or less and the fixed payment when it was $${e:\/\/Field\/risk_self_comp_check_yplus1} or more."}},"ChoiceOrder":["4","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"CustomValidation","CustomValidation":{"Logic":{"0":{"0":{"QuestionID":"QID227","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID227\/SelectableChoice\/2","Operator":"Selected","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID227","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID227\/SelectableChoice\/2","Type":"Expression","LogicType":"Question","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Understanding Question: In Round 1, which of the following is correct?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">I never selected the lottery.<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> "},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression"},"Message":{"messageID":"MS_jHNVdNnhu9SyaST","subMessageID":"VE_ERROR","libraryID":"UR_cZPMLrEO6JJWxpk","description":"Error Text"}}}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID227","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">xrisk_bottomcorner<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 1 <\/span>","LeftOperand":"xrisk_bottomcorner","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"1","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_5yUcDA5EfVrFIVg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID228","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions for Part ${e:\/\/Field\/current_part}, Round ${e:\/\/Field\/xcomp_round} of ...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<strong>Instructions for Part ${e:\/\/Field\/current_part}, Round ${e:\/\/Field\/xcomp_round} of ${e:\/\/Field\/comp_totalrounds} rounds<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nIn Round ${e:\/\/Field\/xcomp_round}, you complete a math task in a <strong>tournament<\/strong>.&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\nFor each problem, you need to select a pair of numbers that sums up to 100. You have 2 minutes to correctly answer as many of the 30 problems as you can. You gain one point for each correct problem and lose one point for each mistake.<br>\n<br>\nYour performance in Round ${e:\/\/Field\/xcomp_round} will be evaluated relative to the performance of the 3 other group members from the Round 2 tournament. The Round 2 tournament is the math task you completed in Round 2, where you and your group members were in a tournament.\n<ul>\n\t<li>If you have more points&nbsp;in Round ${e:\/\/Field\/xcomp_round} than the 3 other group members did in the Round 2 tournament, you are the <strong>winner<\/strong>.<\/li>\n\t<li>If at least one of the 3 other group members has more points&nbsp;in Round 2 than you do in Round ${e:\/\/Field\/xcomp_round}, you are <strong>not the winner <\/strong>and lose the tournament.<\/li>\n\t<li>In the case of a tie, the winner will be randomly determined.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\nThe tournament payment is:\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>If you win, $2 per point.<\/li>\n\t<li>If you lose, $0.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>You maximize your expected additional payment by trying your best to solve as many problems correctly as you can.&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>When you\u2019re ready to start the math task, click the forward arrow button. Once you click the forward arrow button, your 2 minutes will start right away.<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q172","QuestionID":"QID228","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions for Part ${e:\/\/Field\/current_part}, Round ${e:\/\/Field\/xcomp_round} of ...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">comp_selected_chose_tournament<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 1 <\/span>","LeftOperand":"comp_selected_chose_tournament","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"1","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_5yUcDA5EfVrFIVg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID229","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions for Part ${e:\/\/Field\/current_part}, Round ${e:\/\/Field\/xcomp_round} of ...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<strong>Instructions for Part ${e:\/\/Field\/current_part}, Round ${e:\/\/Field\/xcomp_round} of ${e:\/\/Field\/comp_totalrounds} rounds<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nIn Round ${e:\/\/Field\/xcomp_round}, you complete a math task using a fixed payment of <strong>$${e:\/\/Field\/comp_selected_fixed_amount} per point.&nbsp;<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nFor each problem, you need to select a pair of numbers that sums up to 100. You have 2 minutes to correctly answer as many of the 30 problems as you can.&nbsp;You gain one point for each correct problem and lose one point for each mistake.<br>\n<br>\nYou maximize your expected additional payment by trying your best to solve as many problems correctly as you can.<br>\n<br>\nWhen you\u2019re ready to start the math task, click the forward arrow button. Once you click the forward arrow button, your 2 minutes will start right away.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q173","QuestionID":"QID229","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions for Part ${e:\/\/Field\/current_part}, Round ${e:\/\/Field\/xcomp_round} of ...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">comp_selected_chose_tournament<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 0 <\/span>","LeftOperand":"comp_selected_chose_tournament","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"0","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_5yUcDA5EfVrFIVg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID23","SecondaryAttribute":"In 2025, what was your total income from all sources, before taxes?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":["1","10","11","12","13","14","15","16","17","18"],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Less than $30,000"},"10":{"Display":"$30,000 to less than $40,000"},"11":{"Display":"$40,000 to less than $50,000"},"12":{"Display":"$50,000 to less than $60,000"},"13":{"Display":"$60,000 to less than $70,000"},"14":{"Display":"$70,000 to less than $80,000"},"15":{"Display":"$80,000 to less than $90,000"},"16":{"Display":"$90,000 to less than $100,000"},"17":{"Display":"$100,000 or more"},"18":{"Display":"Prefer not to say"}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"income","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":19,"QuestionDescription":"In 2025, what was your total income from all sources, before taxes?","QuestionID":"QID23","QuestionText":"<b>In 2025, what was your total income from all sources, before taxes? \n<\/b>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<b>In 2024, what was your total income from all sources, before taxes? \n<\/b>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"DL","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_5yUcDA5EfVrFIVg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID230","SecondaryAttribute":"Round ${e:\/\/Field\/xcomp_round} Tournament: Winner: $2 per point","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><strong>Round ${e:\/\/Field\/xcomp_round} Tournament: Winner: $2 per point<\/strong><\/span>","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n\tconst qthis = this;\n\tconst questionContainer = this.getQuestionContainer();\n\n\t\/\/ Must be set in Survey Flow before this question:\n\t\/\/ gameRoundCode = P   or   FT   or   C\n\tconst roundCode = \"${e:\/\/Field\/gameRoundCode}\";\n\n\tconst style = document.createElement('style');\n\tstyle.textContent = `\n\t\t.q-grid-3x3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin: 16px 0; max-width: 720px }\n\t\t.q-counter { margin: 8px 0 12px 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.1em; }\n\t\t.q-grid-3x3 > div { aspect-ratio: 2 \/ 1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.5em; transition: background-color .2s, border-color .2s, color .2s }\n\t\t.q-grid-3x3 > div.waiting { background: #f6f8fa; border-color: #ddd; color: #9aa3ad; cursor: not-allowed }\n\t\t.q-grid-3x3 > div.ready { background: #eaf2ff; border-color: #90b4ff; color: #10273f; cursor: pointer }\n\t\t.q-grid-3x3 > div.ready:hover { background: #dbe9ff; border-color: #79a6ff }\n\t\t.q-grid-3x3 > div.finished { background: #f6f6f6; border-color: #d0d0d0; color: #666; cursor: default }\n\t`;\n\tdocument.head.appendChild(style);\n\n\tconst delayMs = 0;\n\tconst maxAttempts = 30;\n\n\tfunction randInt(min, max) {\n\t\twhile (true) {\n\t\t\tconst x = Math.floor(Math.random() * (max - min + 1)) + min;\n\t\t\tif (x % 10 !== 0) return x;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\tfunction shuffle(array) {\n\t\tlet m = array.length;\n\t\twhile (m > 0) {\n\t\t\tconst idx = Math.floor(Math.random() * m);\n\t\t\tm -= 1;\n\t\t\tconst temp = array[m];\n\t\t\tarray[m] = array[idx];\n\t\t\tarray[idx] = temp;\n\t\t}\n\t\treturn array;\n\t}\n\n\tfunction pairKey(a, b) {\n\t\treturn a + ',' + b;\n\t}\n\n\tfunction onesSumTo10(a, b) {\n\t\treturn (a % 10) + (b % 10) === 10;\n\t}\n\n\tfunction pairToString(p) {\n\t\treturn '(' + p[0] + ',' + p[1] + ')';\n\t}\n\n\tfunction serializeSet(set) {\n\t\tlet out = [];\n\t\tlet i = 0;\n\t\twhile (i < set.length) {\n\t\t\tout.push(pairToString(set[i]));\n\t\t\ti += 1;\n\t\t}\n\t\treturn out.join('|');\n\t}\n\n\tfunction edName(base, attemptNumber) {\n\t\tif (typeof attemptNumber === 'number') {\n\t\t\treturn base + roundCode + attemptNumber;\n\t\t}\n\t\treturn base + roundCode;\n\t}\n\n\tfunction setED(name, value) {\n\t\tQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(name, String(value));\n\t}\n\n\tfunction generateEqual100Pair(used, requireOnes10) {\n\t\twhile (true) {\n\t\t\tconst a = randInt(10, 90);\n\t\t\tconst b = 100 - a;\n\n\t\t\tif (b < 10 || b > 99) continue;\n\t\t\tif (b % 10 === 0) continue;\n\n\t\t\tif (requireOnes10 && !onesSumTo10(a, b)) continue;\n\t\t\tif (!requireOnes10 && onesSumTo10(a, b)) continue;\n\n\t\t\tconst key = pairKey(a, b);\n\t\t\tif (used[key]) continue;\n\n\t\t\tused[key] = true;\n\t\t\treturn [a, b];\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\tfunction generateAbove100Pair(used, requireOnes10) {\n\t\twhile (true) {\n\t\t\tconst a = randInt(10, 99);\n\t\t\tconst b = randInt(10, 99);\n\t\t\tconst total = a + b;\n\n\t\t\tif (total <= 100 || total >= 120) continue;\n\n\t\t\tif (requireOnes10 && !onesSumTo10(a, b)) continue;\n\t\t\tif (!requireOnes10 && onesSumTo10(a, b)) continue;\n\n\t\t\tconst key = pairKey(a, b);\n\t\t\tif (used[key]) continue;\n\n\t\t\tused[key] = true;\n\t\t\treturn [a, b];\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\tfunction generateBelow100Pair(used, requireOnes10) {\n\t\twhile (true) {\n\t\t\tconst a = randInt(10, 99);\n\t\t\tconst b = randInt(10, 99);\n\t\t\tconst total = a + b;\n\n\t\t\tif (total <= 80 || total >= 100) continue;\n\n\t\t\tif (requireOnes10 && !onesSumTo10(a, b)) continue;\n\t\t\tif (!requireOnes10 && onesSumTo10(a, b)) continue;\n\n\t\t\tconst key = pairKey(a, b);\n\t\t\tif (used[key]) continue;\n\n\t\t\tused[key] = true;\n\t\t\treturn [a, b];\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\tfunction generateOneSet() {\n\t\tconst used = {};\n\t\tconst set = [];\n\n\t\t\/\/ Exactly 3 of 9 pairs have ones digits summing to 10:\n\t\t\/\/ 1 exact-100, 1 above-100, 1 below-100\n\t\tset.push(generateEqual100Pair(used, true));\n\n\t\tset.push(generateAbove100Pair(used, true));\n\t\tset.push(generateAbove100Pair(used, false));\n\t\tset.push(generateAbove100Pair(used, false));\n\t\tset.push(generateAbove100Pair(used, false));\n\n\t\tset.push(generateBelow100Pair(used, true));\n\t\tset.push(generateBelow100Pair(used, false));\n\t\tset.push(generateBelow100Pair(used, false));\n\t\tset.push(generateBelow100Pair(used, false));\n\n\t\tshuffle(set);\n\t\treturn set;\n\t}\n\n\tconst counter = document.createElement('div');\n\tcounter.className = 'q-counter';\n\tcounter.innerHTML = \"<strong>You have 0 points (0 correct problems, 0 mistakes)<\/strong>\";\n\n\tconst grid = document.createElement('div');\n\tgrid.className = 'q-grid-3x3';\n\n\tquestionContainer.appendChild(counter);\n\tquestionContainer.appendChild(grid);\n\n\tconst cells = [];\n\tlet j = 0;\n\twhile (j < 9) {\n\t\tconst cell = document.createElement('div');\n\t\tgrid.appendChild(cell);\n\t\tcells.push(cell);\n\t\tj += 1;\n\t}\n\n\tlet currentSet = generateOneSet();\n\tlet score = 0;\n\tlet totalAttempted = 0;\n\tlet totalCorrect = 0;\n\tlet totalIncorrect = 0;\n\tlet locked = false;\n\tlet enabled = false;\n\tlet timer = null;\n\tlet finished = false;\n\tlet matrixStartMs = null;\n\n\tfunction computePoints(correct, incorrect) {\n\t\tif (correct <= incorrect) return 0;\n\t\treturn correct - incorrect;\n\t}\n\n\tfunction updateCounter() {\n\t\tconst pointWord = (score === 1) ? \"point\" : \"points\";\n\t\tconst correctWord = (totalCorrect === 1) ? \"problem\" : \"problems\";\n\t\tconst incorrectWord = (totalIncorrect === 1) ? \"mistake\" : \"mistakes\";\n\n\t\tcounter.innerHTML =\n\t\t\t\"<strong>You have \" + score + \" \" + pointWord +\n\t\t\t\" (\" + totalCorrect + \" correct \" + correctWord +\n\t\t\t\", \" + totalIncorrect + \" \" + incorrectWord + \")<\/strong>\";\n\t}\n\n\tfunction setWaiting() {\n\t\tlet k = 0;\n\t\twhile (k < cells.length) {\n\t\t\tcells[k].classList.remove('ready', 'finished');\n\t\t\tcells[k].classList.add('waiting');\n\t\t\tk += 1;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\tfunction setReady() {\n\t\tlet k = 0;\n\t\twhile (k < cells.length) {\n\t\t\tcells[k].classList.remove('waiting', 'finished');\n\t\t\tcells[k].classList.add('ready');\n\t\t\tk += 1;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\tfunction setFinishedView() {\n\t\tlet k = 0;\n\t\twhile (k < cells.length) {\n\t\t\tcells[k].classList.remove('waiting', 'ready');\n\t\t\tcells[k].classList.add('finished');\n\t\t\tk += 1;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\tfunction readyNow() {\n\t\tif (finished) return;\n\t\tenabled = true;\n\t\tmatrixStartMs = Date.now();\n\t\tsetReady();\n\t}\n\n\tfunction scheduleReady() {\n\t\tif (timer) clearTimeout(timer);\n\t\tenabled = false;\n\t\tmatrixStartMs = null;\n\t\tsetWaiting();\n\t\ttimer = setTimeout(readyNow, delayMs);\n\t}\n\n\tfunction render() {\n\t\tlet k = 0;\n\t\twhile (k < 9) {\n\t\t\tconst p = currentSet[k];\n\t\t\tcells[k].textContent = '(' + p[0] + ', ' + p[1] + ')';\n\t\t\tcells[k].dataset.idx = k;\n\t\t\tk += 1;\n\t\t}\n\t\tscheduleReady();\n\t}\n\n\tfunction timeSpentNow() {\n\t\tif (matrixStartMs === null) return '';\n\t\treturn Date.now() - matrixStartMs;\n\t}\n\n\tfunction saveSummary() {\n\t\tsetED(edName('totalCorrect'), totalCorrect);\n\t\tsetED(edName('totalIncorrect'), totalIncorrect);\n\t\tsetED(edName('totalAttempted'), totalAttempted);\n\t\tsetED(edName('totalPoints'), score);\n\t\tsetED(edName('maxAttempts'), maxAttempts);\n\t}\n\n\tfunction saveAttempt(attemptNumber, matrixSet, chosenPair, isCorrect, timeSpentMs) {\n\t\tsetED(edName('matrixNumber', attemptNumber), attemptNumber);\n\t\tsetED(edName('matrixPairs', attemptNumber), serializeSet(matrixSet));\n\t\tsetED(edName('chosenPair', attemptNumber), pairToString(chosenPair));\n\t\tsetED(edName('isCorrect', attemptNumber), isCorrect);\n\t\tsetED(edName('timeSpentMs', attemptNumber), timeSpentMs);\n\t\tsetED(edName('matrixExitTimeSpentMs', attemptNumber), timeSpentMs);\n\t}\n\n\tfunction initializeEmptyFields() {\n\t\tlet n = 1;\n\t\twhile (n <= maxAttempts) {\n\t\t\tsetED(edName('matrixNumber', n), '');\n\t\t\tsetED(edName('matrixPairs', n), '');\n\t\t\tsetED(edName('chosenPair', n), '');\n\t\t\tsetED(edName('isCorrect', n), '');\n\t\t\tsetED(edName('timeSpentMs', n), '');\n\t\t\tsetED(edName('matrixExitTimeSpentMs', n), '');\n\t\t\tn += 1;\n\t\t}\n\n\t\tsetED(edName('surveyExitTimeSpentMs'), '');\n\t\tsetED(edName('totalIncorrect'), '');\n\t\tsetED(edName('totalPoints'), '');\n\t\tsaveSummary();\n\t}\n\n\tfunction finishGame() {\n\t\tfinished = true;\n\t\tenabled = false;\n\t\tlocked = true;\n\t\tif (timer) clearTimeout(timer);\n\n\t\tconst surveyExitTimeSpentMs = timeSpentNow();\n\t\tsetED(edName('surveyExitTimeSpentMs'), surveyExitTimeSpentMs);\n\t\tsaveSummary();\n\t\tsetFinishedView();\n\n\t\tconsole.log('GAME FINISHED', {\n\t\t\troundCode: roundCode,\n\t\t\ttotalCorrect: totalCorrect,\n\t\t\ttotalIncorrect: totalIncorrect,\n\t\t\ttotalAttempted: totalAttempted,\n\t\t\ttotalPoints: score,\n\t\t\tsurveyExitTimeSpentMs: surveyExitTimeSpentMs\n\t\t});\n\n\t\t\/\/ No autoadvance here.\n\t}\n\n\tfunction nextSet() {\n\t\tcurrentSet = generateOneSet();\n\t\trender();\n\t}\n\n\tfunction pick(e) {\n\t\tif (!enabled) return;\n\t\tif (locked) return;\n\t\tif (finished) return;\n\n\t\tlocked = true;\n\n\t\tconst idx = Number(e.currentTarget.dataset.idx);\n\t\tconst p = currentSet[idx];\n\t\tconst ok = (p[0] + p[1] === 100) ? 1 : 0;\n\t\tconst attemptNumber = totalAttempted + 1;\n\t\tconst matrixShown = currentSet.slice(0);\n\t\tconst timeSpentMs = timeSpentNow();\n\n\t\ttotalAttempted += 1;\n\n\t\tif (ok === 1) {\n\t\t\ttotalCorrect += 1;\n\t\t} else {\n\t\t\ttotalIncorrect += 1;\n\t\t}\n\n\t\tscore = computePoints(totalCorrect, totalIncorrect);\n\n\t\tsaveAttempt(attemptNumber, matrixShown, p, ok, timeSpentMs);\n\t\tupdateCounter();\n\t\tsaveSummary();\n\n\t\tconsole.log('ANSWER SAVED', {\n\t\t\troundCode: roundCode,\n\t\t\tattemptNumber: attemptNumber,\n\t\t\tmatrixNumberVar: edName('matrixNumber', attemptNumber),\n\t\t\tmatrixPairsVar: edName('matrixPairs', attemptNumber),\n\t\t\tchosenPairVar: edName('chosenPair', attemptNumber),\n\t\t\tisCorrectVar: edName('isCorrect', attemptNumber),\n\t\t\ttimeSpentVar: edName('timeSpentMs', attemptNumber),\n\t\t\tmatrixExitTimeSpentVar: edName('matrixExitTimeSpentMs', attemptNumber),\n\t\t\tmatrixPairs: serializeSet(matrixShown),\n\t\t\tchosenPair: pairToString(p),\n\t\t\tisCorrect: ok,\n\t\t\ttimeSpentMs: timeSpentMs,\n\t\t\ttotalCorrectSoFar: totalCorrect,\n\t\t\ttotalIncorrectSoFar: totalIncorrect,\n\t\t\ttotalAttemptedSoFar: totalAttempted,\n\t\t\ttotalPointsSoFar: score\n\t\t});\n\n\t\tif (totalAttempted >= maxAttempts) {\n\t\t\tfinishGame();\n\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t}\n\n\t\tnextSet();\n\t\tlocked = false;\n\t}\n\n\tlet k = 0;\n\twhile (k < cells.length) {\n\t\tcells[k].addEventListener('click', pick);\n\t\tk += 1;\n\t}\n\n\tinitializeEmptyFields();\n\tupdateCounter();\n\trender();\n});","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q174","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Round ${e:\/\/Field\/xcomp_round} Tournament: Winner: $2 per point","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID230","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">comp_selected_chose_tournament<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 1 <\/span>","LeftOperand":"comp_selected_chose_tournament","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"1","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_5yUcDA5EfVrFIVg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID231","SecondaryAttribute":"Recall that: You need to select a pair of numbers that sums up to 100. You have 2 minutes to corr...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Recall that:\n<ul>\n\t<li>You need to select a pair of numbers that sums up to 100.<\/li>\n\t<li>You have 2 minutes to correctly answer as many of the 30 problems as you can.<\/li>\n\t<li>You gain one point for each correct problem and lose one point for each mistake.<\/li>\n\t<li>You receive a fixed payment of $${e:\/\/Field\/comp_selected_fixed_amount} per point.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<div>Remember, you can only advance once the 2 minutes are over.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q175","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Recall that: You need to select a pair of numbers that sums up to 100. You have 2 minutes to corr...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID231","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">comp_selected_chose_tournament<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 0 <\/span>","LeftOperand":"comp_selected_chose_tournament","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"0","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_5yUcDA5EfVrFIVg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID239","SecondaryAttribute":"Understanding Question: For the math task, which of the following is correct?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<strong>Understanding Question:<\/strong> For the math task, which of the following is correct?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q188","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Understanding Question: For the math task, which of the following is correct?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I selected the tournament payment when the fixed payment was $${e:\/\/Field\/comp_self_comp_check_y} or less and the fixed payment when it was $${e:\/\/Field\/comp_self_comp_check_yplus1} or more"},"2":{"Display":"I never selected the tournament payment"},"3":{"Display":"I always selected the tournament payment"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"CustomValidation","CustomValidation":{"Logic":{"0":{"0":{"QuestionID":"QID239","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID239\/SelectableChoice\/2","Operator":"Selected","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID239","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID239\/SelectableChoice\/2","Type":"Expression","LogicType":"Question","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Understanding Question: For the math task, which of the following is correct?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">I never selected the tournament 