ics in the United States, where would you place yourself on this scale?<\/b>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_5yUcDA5EfVrFIVg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID240","SecondaryAttribute":"Understanding Question: For the math task, which of the following is correct?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<strong>Understanding Question:<\/strong> For the math task, which of the following is correct?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q189","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Understanding Question: For the math task, which of the following is correct?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I selected the tournament payment when the fixed payment was $${e:\/\/Field\/comp_self_comp_check_y} or less and the fixed payment when it was $${e:\/\/Field\/comp_self_comp_check_yplus1} or more"},"2":{"Display":"I never selected the tournament payment"},"3":{"Display":"I always selected the tournament payment"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"CustomValidation","CustomValidation":{"Logic":{"0":{"0":{"QuestionID":"QID240","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID240\/SelectableChoice\/3","Operator":"Selected","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID240","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID240\/SelectableChoice\/3","Type":"Expression","LogicType":"Question","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Understanding Question: For the math task, which of the following is correct?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">I always selected the tournament payment<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> "},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression"},"Message":{"messageID":"MS_jHNVdNnhu9SyaST","subMessageID":"VE_ERROR","libraryID":"UR_cZPMLrEO6JJWxpk","description":"Error Text"}}}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID240","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">xcomp_topcorner<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 1 <\/span>","LeftOperand":"xcomp_topcorner","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"1","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_5yUcDA5EfVrFIVg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID241","SecondaryAttribute":"Click to write the question text","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Click to write the question text","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q190","QuestionID":"QID241","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Click to write the question text","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n    try {\n        console.log(\"=== COMPETITIVENESS REVEAL SCRIPT START ===\");\n\n        var selectedRowRaw = \"${e:\/\/Field\/comp_selected_row}\";\n        var selectedFixedAmountRaw = \"${e:\/\/Field\/comp_selected_fixed_amount}\";\n        var selectedChoiceTextRaw = \"${e:\/\/Field\/comp_selected_choice_text}\";\n        var selectedChoseTournamentRaw = \"${e:\/\/Field\/comp_selected_chose_tournament}\";\n        var xcompRoundRaw = \"${e:\/\/Field\/xcomp_round}\";\n\n        var selectedRow = parseInt(selectedRowRaw, 10);\n        var selectedFixedAmount = parseFloat(selectedFixedAmountRaw);\n        var selectedChoiceText = String(selectedChoiceTextRaw);\n        var selectedChoseTournament = String(selectedChoseTournamentRaw);\n        var xcompRound = parseInt(xcompRoundRaw, 10);\n\n        var roundDisplay = \"Round \" + xcompRound;\n\n        \/\/ ------------------------------------------------------------\n        \/\/ Normalize choice text\n        \/\/ FIX: The MPL stores \"tournament payment\" and \"fixed payment\",\n        \/\/ not \"choose the tournament\" \/ \"choose the fixed payment\".\n        \/\/ Updated conditions to match actual stored values.\n        \/\/ ------------------------------------------------------------\n        if (selectedChoiceText === \"tournament payment\" || selectedChoiceText === \"choose the tournament\") {\n            selectedChoiceText = \"the tournament payment\";\n        }\n        if (selectedChoiceText === \"fixed payment\" || selectedChoiceText === \"choose the fixed payment\") {\n            selectedChoiceText = \"the fixed payment of $\" + selectedFixedAmount.toFixed(2);\n        }\n\n        \/\/ ------------------------------------------------------------\n        \/\/ Consequence sentence\n        \/\/ ------------------------------------------------------------\n        var consequenceSentence = \"\";\n\n        if (selectedChoseTournament === \"1\") {\n            consequenceSentence = \"a tournament payment, where, if you win, you receive $2 per point and if you lose you receive $0.\";\n        } else {\n            consequenceSentence = \"a fixed payment of $\" + selectedFixedAmount.toFixed(2) + \" per point.\";\n        }\n\n        \/\/ ------------------------------------------------------------\n        \/\/ Build full text (FIXED STRUCTURE)\n        \/\/ ------------------------------------------------------------\n        var fullText =\n            \"<p style='margin-bottom:16px;'>You are now in \" + roundDisplay + \". Recall that at the end of Round 2 and before Round 3, you saw a list of 16 rows. \" +\n            \"The choice in each row determines how you are paid for the math task in this round, \" + roundDisplay + \".<\/p>\" +\n\n            \"<p style='margin-bottom:16px;'>The randomly selected row-that-counts is: row \" + selectedRow + \".<\/p>\" +\n\n            \"<p style='margin-bottom:16px;'>In this row, you chose between a tournament payment where, if you win, you receive $2 per point and a fixed payment of $\" +\n            selectedFixedAmount.toFixed(2) + \" per point.<\/p>\" +\n\n            \"<p>You selected <strong>\" + selectedChoiceText + \"<\/strong>. That is, for the math task in \" + roundDisplay + \", you receive \" +\n            \"<strong>\" + consequenceSentence + \"<\/strong><\/p>\";\n\n        jQuery(\"#\" + this.questionId + \" .QuestionText\").html(fullText);\n\n    } catch (err) {\n        console.error(\"ERROR IN COMPETITIVENESS REVEAL SCRIPT:\", err);\n    }\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_5yUcDA5EfVrFIVg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID242","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions for Part ${e:\/\/Field\/current_part}, Round 3 of ${e:\/\/Field\/comp_totalrounds} rounds...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<strong>Instructions for Part ${e:\/\/Field\/current_part}, Round 3 of ${e:\/\/Field\/comp_totalrounds} rounds<\/strong>\n<div class=\"relative w-full mt-4 mb-1\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"relative\">\n<div class=\"h-full min-h-0 min-w-0\">\n<div class=\"h-full min-h-0 min-w-0\">\n<div class=\"border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse\/1.1 rounded-3xl\">\n<div class=\"h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse\/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback\">\n<div class=\"pe-11 pt-3\">\n<div class=\"relative z-0 flex max-w-full\">\n<div class=\"q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch \u037cs \u037c16\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\">\n<div class=\"cm-scroller\">\n<div class=\"cm-content q9tKkq_readonly\"><br \/>\n<span>In this round, you earn a fixed payment of $1.50 for answering 12 questions.<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"cm-content q9tKkq_readonly\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"cm-content q9tKkq_readonly\">These questions will ask you to compare your choices between tournament payment and fixed payment to those of other participants who went through the same study and are <strong>equally likely to be men or women.<\/strong><\/div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li class=\"cm-content q9tKkq_readonly\"><span>Recall, for the math task, <strong>you never selected the tournament payment.&nbsp;<\/strong><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<pre class=\"overflow-visible! px-0!\" data-end=\"1833\" data-start=\"1282\">\n&nbsp;<\/pre>\n\n<div class=\"relative w-full mt-4 mb-1\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"relative\">\n<div class=\"h-full min-h-0 min-w-0\">\n<div class=\"h-full min-h-0 min-w-0\">\n<div class=\"border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse\/1.1 rounded-3xl\">\n<div class=\"h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse\/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback\">\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"pe-11 pt-3\">\n<div class=\"relative z-0 flex max-w-full\">\n<div class=\"q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch \u037cs \u037c16\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\">\n<div class=\"cm-scroller\">\n<div class=\"cm-content q9tKkq_readonly\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q191","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions for Part ${e:\/\/Field\/current_part}, Round 3 of ${e:\/\/Field\/comp_totalrounds} rounds...","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">xcomp_bottomcorner<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 1 <\/span>","LeftOperand":"xcomp_bottomcorner","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"1","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID242","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function () {\n\tvar qthis = this;\n    var controller = this.getQuestionContainer();\n\n    \/\/ =========================\n    \/\/ SET THESE QIDs\n    \/\/ =========================\n    var qidQ2Interior = \"QID174\";  \/\/ question 2 if xcomp_interior == 1\n    var qidQ2Bottom = \"QID239\";    \/\/ question 2 if xcomp_bottomcorner == 1\n    var qidQ2Top = \"QID240\";       \/\/ question 2 if xcomp_topcorner == 1\n\n    \/\/ Read embedded variables\n    var isInterior = \"${e:\/\/Field\/xcomp_interior}\" == \"1\";\n    var isBottom   = \"${e:\/\/Field\/xcomp_bottomcorner}\" == \"1\";\n    var isTop      = \"${e:\/\/Field\/xcomp_topcorner}\" == \"1\";\n\n    \/\/ Determine which version of question 2 to use\n    var qidQuestion2 = null;\n    if (isInterior) {\n        qidQuestion2 = qidQ2Interior;\n    } else if (isBottom) {\n        qidQuestion2 = qidQ2Bottom;\n    } else if (isTop) {\n        qidQuestion2 = qidQ2Top;\n    }\n\n    \/\/ Questions to hide\/reveal\n    var questionIDs = [qidQuestion2].filter(Boolean);\n\n    \/\/ Unique key for this page\n    var revealKey = \"revealed_\" + this.questionId;\n\n    function getNextButton() {\n        return document.getElementById(\"NextButton\");\n    }\n\n    function forceHideNextButton() {\n        qthis.hideNextButton();\n        var nextButton = getNextButton();\n        if (nextButton) {\n            nextButton.style.display = \"none\";\n            nextButton.style.visibility = \"hidden\";\n        }\n    }\n\n    function forceShowNextButton() {\n        qthis.showNextButton();\n        var nextButton = getNextButton();\n        if (nextButton) {\n            nextButton.style.display = \"\";\n            nextButton.style.visibility = \"\";\n        }\n    }\n\n    function hideQuestions() {\n        questionIDs.forEach(function (qid) {\n            var q = document.getElementById(qid);\n            if (q) {\n                q.style.visibility = \"hidden\";\n                q.style.height = \"0px\";\n                q.style.overflow = \"hidden\";\n                q.style.margin = \"0\";\n                q.style.padding = \"0\";\n            }\n        });\n    }\n\n    function showQuestions() {\n        questionIDs.forEach(function (qid) {\n            var q = document.getElementById(qid);\n            if (q) {\n                q.style.visibility = \"visible\";\n                q.style.height = \"auto\";\n                q.style.overflow = \"visible\";\n                q.style.margin = \"\";\n                q.style.padding = \"\";\n            }\n        });\n\n        setTimeout(function () {\n            window.dispatchEvent(new Event(\"resize\"));\n        }, 50);\n    }\n\n    var alreadyRevealed = sessionStorage.getItem(revealKey) === \"true\";\n\n    if (alreadyRevealed) {\n        showQuestions();\n        forceShowNextButton();\n        return;\n    }\n\n    \/\/ Hide immediately\n    forceHideNextButton();\n    hideQuestions();\n\n    \/\/ Extra protection in case Qualtrics redraws footer after load\n    var hideInterval = setInterval(function () {\n        if (sessionStorage.getItem(revealKey) !== \"true\") {\n            forceHideNextButton();\n        } else {\n            clearInterval(hideInterval);\n        }\n    }, 300);\n\n    \/\/ Create centered button\n    var wrapper = document.createElement(\"div\");\n    wrapper.style.textAlign = \"center\";\n    wrapper.style.margin = \"30px 0\";\n\n\t\t\/\/ Styling\n\/\/ Styling\n\/\/ Read embedded color variables\nvar bgColor = \"${e:\/\/Field\/understanding_button_backgroundColor}\";\nvar borderColor = \"${e:\/\/Field\/understanding_button_border}\";\nvar textColor = \"${e:\/\/Field\/understanding_button_color}\";\n\n\/\/ Fallbacks (in case something is missing)\nbgColor = bgColor || \"#FFA500\";\nborderColor = borderColor || \"#cc8400\";\ntextColor = textColor || \"#2b1a00\";\n\nvar button = document.createElement(\"button\");\nbutton.type = \"button\";\n    button.innerHTML = \"Click to answer an understanding question\";\n\n\/\/ Styling\nbutton.style.padding = \"12px 24px\";\nbutton.style.cursor = \"pointer\";\nbutton.style.backgroundColor = bgColor;\nbutton.style.border = \"1px solid \" + borderColor;\nbutton.style.borderRadius = \"6px\";\nbutton.style.fontSize = \"16px\";\nbutton.style.fontWeight = \"600\";\nbutton.style.color = textColor;\n\t\n\t\n \n\n    wrapper.appendChild(button);\n    controller.appendChild(wrapper);\n\n    button.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n        sessionStorage.setItem(revealKey, \"true\");\n\n        showQuestions();\n        forceShowNextButton();\n\n        clearInterval(hideInterval);\n        wrapper.remove();\n    });\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function () {\n    \/\/ Hide again on ready, in case theme scripts re-show it after onload\n    if (sessionStorage.getItem(\"revealed_\" + this.questionId) !== \"true\") {\n        this.hideNextButton();\n        var nextButton = document.getElementById(\"NextButton\");\n        if (nextButton) {\n            nextButton.style.display = \"none\";\n            nextButton.style.visibility = \"hidden\";\n        }\n    }\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_5yUcDA5EfVrFIVg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID243","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions for Part ${e:\/\/Field\/current_part}, Round 3 of ${e:\/\/Field\/comp_totalrounds} rounds...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<strong>Instructions for Part ${e:\/\/Field\/current_part}, Round 3 of ${e:\/\/Field\/comp_totalrounds} rounds<\/strong><br \/>\n&nbsp;\n<div class=\"relative w-full mt-4 mb-1\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"relative\">\n<div class=\"h-full min-h-0 min-w-0\">\n<div class=\"h-full min-h-0 min-w-0\">\n<div class=\"border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse\/1.1 rounded-3xl\">\n<div class=\"h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse\/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback\">\n<div class=\"pe-11 pt-3\">\n<div class=\"relative z-0 flex max-w-full\">\n<div class=\"q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch \u037cs \u037c16\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\">\n<div class=\"cm-scroller\">\n<div class=\"cm-content q9tKkq_readonly\"><span>In this round, you earn a fixed payment of $1.50 for answering 12 questions.<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"cm-content q9tKkq_readonly\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"cm-content q9tKkq_readonly\">These questions will ask you to compare your choices between tournament payment and fixed payment to those of other participants who went through the same study and are <strong>equally likely to be men or women.<\/strong><\/div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li class=\"cm-content q9tKkq_readonly\"><span>Recall, for the math task, <strong>you always selected the tournament payment.&nbsp;<\/strong><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q192","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions for Part ${e:\/\/Field\/current_part}, Round 3 of ${e:\/\/Field\/comp_totalrounds} rounds...","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">xcomp_topcorner<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 1 <\/span>","LeftOperand":"xcomp_topcorner","LogicType":"EmbeddedField","Operator":"EqualTo","RightOperand":"1","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID243","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function () {\n\tvar qthis = this;\n    var controller = this.getQuestionContainer();\n\n    \/\/ =========================\n    \/\/ SET THESE QIDs\n    \/\/ =========================\n    var qidQ2Interior = \"QID174\";  \/\/ question 2 if xcomp_interior == 1\n    var qidQ2Bottom = \"QID239\";    \/\/ question 2 if xcomp_bottomcorner == 1\n    var qidQ2Top = \"QID240\";       \/\/ question 2 if xcomp_topcorner == 1\n\n    \/\/ Read embedded variables\n    var isInterior = \"${e:\/\/Field\/xcomp_interior}\" == \"1\";\n    var isBottom   = \"${e:\/\/Field\/xcomp_bottomcorner}\" == \"1\";\n    var isTop      = \"${e:\/\/Field\/xcomp_topcorner}\" == \"1\";\n\n    \/\/ Determine which version of question 2 to use\n    var qidQuestion2 = null;\n    if (isInterior) {\n        qidQuestion2 = qidQ2Interior;\n    } else if (isBottom) {\n        qidQuestion2 = qidQ2Bottom;\n    } else if (isTop) {\n        qidQuestion2 = qidQ2Top;\n    }\n\n    \/\/ Questions to hide\/reveal\n    var questionIDs = [qidQuestion2].filter(Boolean);\n\n    \/\/ Unique key for this page\n    var revealKey = \"revealed_\" + this.questionId;\n\n    function getNextButton() {\n        return document.getElementById(\"NextButton\");\n    }\n\n    function forceHideNextButton() {\n        qthis.hideNextButton();\n        var nextButton = getNextButton();\n        if (nextButton) {\n            nextButton.style.display = \"none\";\n            nextButton.style.visibility = \"hidden\";\n        }\n    }\n\n    function forceShowNextButton() {\n        qthis.showNextButton();\n        var nextButton = getNextButton();\n        if (nextButton) {\n            nextButton.style.display = \"\";\n            nextButton.style.visibility = \"\";\n        }\n    }\n\n    function hideQuestions() {\n        questionIDs.forEach(function (qid) {\n            var q = document.getElementById(qid);\n            if (q) {\n                q.style.visibility = \"hidden\";\n                q.style.height = \"0px\";\n                q.style.overflow = \"hidden\";\n                q.style.margin = \"0\";\n                q.style.padding = \"0\";\n            }\n        });\n    }\n\n    function showQuestions() {\n        questionIDs.forEach(function (qid) {\n            var q = document.getElementById(qid);\n            if (q) {\n                q.style.visibility = \"visible\";\n                q.style.height = \"auto\";\n                q.style.overflow = \"visible\";\n                q.style.margin = \"\";\n                q.style.padding = \"\";\n            }\n        });\n\n        setTimeout(function () {\n            window.dispatchEvent(new Event(\"resize\"));\n        }, 50);\n    }\n\n    var alreadyRevealed = sessionStorage.getItem(revealKey) === \"true\";\n\n    if (alreadyRevealed) {\n        showQuestions();\n        forceShowNextButton();\n        return;\n    }\n\n    \/\/ Hide immediately\n    forceHideNextButton();\n    hideQuestions();\n\n    \/\/ Extra protection in case Qualtrics redraws footer after load\n    var hideInterval = setInterval(function () {\n        if (sessionStorage.getItem(revealKey) !== \"true\") {\n            forceHideNextButton();\n        } else {\n            clearInterval(hideInterval);\n        }\n    }, 300);\n\n    \/\/ Create centered button\n    var wrapper = document.createElement(\"div\");\n    wrapper.style.textAlign = \"center\";\n    wrapper.style.margin = \"30px 0\";\n\n\t\t\/\/ Styling\n\/\/ Styling\n\/\/ Read embedded color variables\nvar bgColor = \"${e:\/\/Field\/understanding_button_backgroundColor}\";\nvar borderColor = \"${e:\/\/Field\/understanding_button_border}\";\nvar textColor = \"${e:\/\/Field\/understanding_button_color}\";\n\n\/\/ Fallbacks (in case something is missing)\nbgColor = bgColor || \"#FFA500\";\nborderColor = borderColor || \"#cc8400\";\ntextColor = textColor || \"#2b1a00\";\n\nvar button = document.createElement(\"button\");\nbutton.type = \"button\";\n    button.innerHTML = \"Click to answer an understanding question\";\n\n\/\/ Styling\nbutton.style.padding = \"12px 24px\";\nbutton.style.cursor = \"pointer\";\nbutton.style.backgroundColor = bgColor;\nbutton.style.border = \"1px solid \" + borderColor;\nbutton.style.borderRadius = \"6px\";\nbutton.style.fontSize = \"16px\";\nbutton.style.fontWeight = \"600\";\nbutton.style.color = textColor;\n\t\n\t\n \n\n    wrapper.appendChild(button);\n    controller.appendChild(wrapper);\n\n    button.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n        sessionStorage.setItem(revealKey, \"true\");\n\n        showQuestions();\n        forceShowNextButton();\n\n        clearInterval(hideInterval);\n        wrapper.remove();\n    });\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function () {\n    \/\/ Hide again on ready, in case theme scripts re-show it after onload\n    if (sessionStorage.getItem(\"revealed_\" + this.questionId) !== \"true\") {\n        this.hideNextButton();\n        var nextButton = document.getElementById(\"NextButton\");\n        if (nextButton) {\n            nextButton.style.display = \"none\";\n            nextButton.style.visibility = \"hidden\";\n        }\n    }\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_5yUcDA5EfVrFIVg","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID244","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q193","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MaxSeconds":"0"}